{
  "_comment": "Genome-wide original-FLARE pin (same recipe as chr20_flat_props_pin_t): whole cohort, EM off, T pinned AFR:8 AMR:12 others:8, FLARE defaults for props/weights/mu. Root entity aou_lr_chrom; this.* names verified against the live table 2026-10-09. em is a literal false, NOT this.em (the chr1 row says true from the earlier EM run). Map outputs anc_vcf -> this.lai_anc_vcf, anc_vcf_index -> this.lai_anc_vcf_index, models_tsv -> this.lai_models_tsv: new columns, so the existing chr1/chr22 anc_vcf/models_tsv from previous runs are not overwritten.",
